> topic fallback includes cv

// Tratamento de Sentenças Desconhecidas (POP-AKR-003), adapted: a single
// flat unknownStreak counts consecutive unrecognized messages (reset by
// setintent in begin.rive on any real match — see the comment there for
// why this is flat instead of per-botIntention like Akira's ctrlU<...>).
//
// First miss priority: (1) a custom per-intention hint if userIntention
// has one defined (unknownhint_<userIntention> in begin.rive) — for cases
// where the bot was expecting input in a specific format, e.g. asking for
// the visitor's name, and "still asking about your name?" wouldn't
// actually tell them what to type; (2) otherwise the generic contextual
// "still asking about <botIntention>?" fallback.
//
// Second+ consecutive miss: repeating that clarifying question isn't
// working, so drop the topic framing and fall back to the plain generic
// menu instead ("Muda de assunto" in the Fluxograma) — same text as the
// no-context default, reached here on purpose rather than by omission.
+ *
* <get unknownStreak> >= 1 => <add unknownStreak=1>I did not quite follow. You can ask about Wilson's summary, contact details, skills, languages, education, or experience at Smart Debrief, Moomenti, Mobiweb, Red IT, or Exact Code Sistemas.
* <bot unknownhint_<get userIntention>> != undefined => <add unknownStreak=1><bot unknownhint_<get userIntention>>
* <get botIntention> != undefined => <add unknownStreak=1>Sorry, I did not quite follow — still asking about <get botIntention>? You can also ask about Wilson's summary, contact details, skills, languages, education, or experience.
* <get name> != undefined => <add unknownStreak=1>I did not fully get that, <get name>. You can ask about Wilson's summary, contact details, skills, languages, education, or experience at Smart Debrief, Moomenti, Mobiweb, Red IT, or Exact Code Sistemas.
- <add unknownStreak=1>I did not quite follow. You can ask about Wilson's summary, contact details, skills, languages, education, or experience at Smart Debrief, Moomenti, Mobiweb, Red IT, or Exact Code Sistemas.

